          "worked_solution": "Fernando sold $198\\,\\text{kg}$ of dog food in $6$ days. Since each day he sold the same amount of food, he sold $198÷6$ kilograms of food each day.\n\nWe start by writing down the question using long division notation:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"150\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"20\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$6$</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$\\,\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{1\\,\\phantom{|}9\\,\\phantom{|}8}$</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n<td width=\"250\" align=\"left\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"20\">\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\nNotice that $1$ (the number of hundreds in $198$) is less than the divisor $6.$ Therefore, we should consider both the hundreds and tens:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"150\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$3$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"20\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$6$</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$\\,\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{1\\,\\phantom{|}9\\,\\phantom{|}8}$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$↓$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n<td width=\"250\" align=\"left\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Divide: $19÷6=3\\,\\text{R}\\,1$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Write over tens: $3$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"25\">\n<td>Multiply: $6\\times 3=18$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Subtract: $19-18=1$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"25\">\n<td>Bring down: $8$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\nNext, we consider the ones:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"150\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$3$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$3$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"20\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$6$</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$\\,\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{1\\,\\phantom{|}9\\,\\phantom{|}8}$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$\\boxed{\\text{0}}$</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n<td width=\"250\" align=\"left\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Divide: $18÷6=3$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Write over ones: $3$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"25\">\n<td>Multiply: $6\\times 3=18$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"20\"> \n<td>Subtract: $18-18=0$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\nWe get the remainder $0$, so the division is done.\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n198÷6=33.\n$$",
